   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The Al'Aketh cult claims that Al'Akir the \"Windlord\" will save us from our current woes here on Zephras. If Al'Akir is real and really is the ruler of Skywall, why did the wind spirits refuse to speak of him for so long?\r\n\r\nEither he isn't real, or even worse, he's real and he's not as benevolent as the cult claims him to be. Either way, nothing about what the cult is doing is good for us normal folk.",
